 },
 "voice": "kokoro:am_michael",
 "sections": [
  {
   "name": "Why Your Wheels Spin at Different Speeds",
   "lines": [
    [
     "c07_1",
     {
      "label": "hook",
      "head": "Your wheels spin at *different speeds*",
      "pose": "point",
      "face": "wow",
      "prop": {
       "type": "diff"
      }
     },
     "Every time you turn a corner, your left and right wheels spin at different speeds."
    ],
    [
     "c07_2",
     {
      "label": "why",
      "head": "The outside wheel goes *farther*",
      "pose": "present",
      "face": "smile",
      "prop": {
       "type": "diff"
      }
     },
     "In a turn, the outer wheel travels a longer path than the inner wheel, in the same amount of time."
    ],
    [
     "c07_3",
     {
      "label": "problem",
      "head": "A solid axle would *scrub*",
      "pose": "shrug",
      "face": "worried",
      "prop": {
       "type": "tags",
       "items": [
        "TYRE SCRUB",
        "WEAR",
        "BAD HANDLING"
       ]
      }
     },
     "If both driven wheels were locked together, one would have to skid. Tyres would wear, and the car would fight every corner."
    ],
    [
     "c07_4",
     {
      "label": "the fix",
      "head": "The *differential* fixes it",
      "pose": "present",
      "face": "grin",
      "prop": {
       "type": "diff",
       "gearset": true
      }
     },
     "The differential, a clever set of gears, lets the two wheels turn at different speeds while both are still driven."
    ],
    [
     "c07_5",
     {
      "label": "weakness",
      "head": "The weakness: *one wheel spin*",
      "pose": "facepalm",
      "face": "sad",
      "prop": {
       "type": "stat",
       "big": "STUCK",
       "sub": "ONE WHEEL SPINS, THE OTHER GETS NOTHING"
      }
     },
     "A simple open diff sends power where it is easiest to go. On ice or mud, that is the wheel that is spinning."
    ],
    [
     "c07_6",
     {
      "label": "lsd",
      "head": "*Limited slip* fights back",
      "pose": "count",
      "face": "smug",
      "prop": {
       "type": "checklist",
       "items": [
        [
         "Open diff: cheap, smooth",
         true
        ],
        [
         "Limited slip: better grip",
         true
        ],
        [
         "Locker: off-road hero",
         true
        ]
       ]
      }
     },
     "Limited slip and locking differentials push power to the wheel with grip, which is why off roaders and sports cars use them."
    ],
    [
     "c07_7",
     {
      "label": "awd",
      "head": "All wheel drive uses *several*",
      "pose": "think",
      "face": "think",
      "prop": {
       "type": "carmap",
       "hi": [
        "diff",
        "gearbox"
       ]
      }
     },
     "All wheel drive cars may have a differential at the front, the rear, and one in the middle."
    ],
    [
     "c07_8",
     {
      "label": "takeaway",
      "head": "Corners need a *diff*",
      "pose": "thumbs",
      "face": "grin",
      "prop": {
       "type": "diff",
       "gearset": true
      }
     },
     "No differential, no smooth corners. A small box of gears doing a very clever job."
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}